        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"The Moon Represents My Heart\", \"Ode to the Republic of China\"\n- People: Teresa Teng, Fei Yu-Ching\n- Topics: Mandarin songs, multilingual recording\n\nFacts:\n- \"The Moon Represents My Heart\" is a Mandarin song.\n- Teresa Teng made \"The Moon Represents My Heart\" famous.\n- Teresa Teng recorded songs in Mandarin, Taiwanese Hokkien, Cantonese, Japanese, Indonesian, and English.\n- Fei Yu-Ching and Teresa Teng were among the singers who performed \"Ode to the Republic of China\".",
